  # Why: A store failure mid-search must not fabricate an audit record
  @task:TASK-ABL1-003
  @edge-case
  Scenario: A failed store search writes no retrieval-log entry
    Given the fixture arm is active with a resolvable fixture DSN
    And the store search fails with an error
